# ForgeAI

ForgeAI is a conversational full-stack app builder: conversation produces a runnable application
that can be refined through later conversation.

Document priority is docs/architecture.md, AGENTS.md, the artifact reference, then the architecture
Skill. Architecture defines durable goals and invariants; current code, schemas, migrations, and
tests define present implementation details.

Work only on the current user-approved, coherent increment. Do not infer or document a permanently
fixed project sequence, route set, stage list, agent count, retry budget, or directory layout.

Review starts from the current change and its direct callers, consumers, contracts, persistence,
security or runtime boundaries, and tests. Expand only when the impact or evidence is broader; do
not scan the whole repository by default.

Before architecture-sensitive backend work, read the relevant parts of docs/architecture.md and
.agents/skills/forgeai-architecture/SKILL.md.
